(923, 'caste', 1, '/kɑːst/', 'Any of the hereditary social classes and subclasses of South Asian societies.', '（印度的）種姓制度、階級', 'https://api.dictionaryapi.dev/media/pronunciations/en/caste-us.mp3', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
