(4162, 'none', 4, '/nɒn/', 'To no extent, in no way.', '一點也不、絕不（副詞用法）', 'https://api.dictionaryapi.dev/media/pronunciations/en/none-1-us.mp3', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
