(4620, 'poetry', 1, '/ˈpəʊɪtɹi/', 'Literature composed in verse or language exhibiting conscious attention to patterns and rhythm.', '詩歌、詩集、詩意', 'https://api.dictionaryapi.dev/media/pronunciations/en/poetry-us.mp3', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
