(6285, 'tsunami', 1, '/suˈnæmi/', 'A very large and destructive wave, generally caused by a tremendous disturbance in the ocean, such as an undersea earthquake or volcanic eruption. Tsunami are usually a series of waves, or wave train.', '海嘯', 'https://dictionaryapi.dev/tsunami', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
